MiOS Hypr3D edge quality (applies after hypr3d-mios-stills.patch). One glass look in the room, as on the flat
desktop with the same hyprglass preset, and clean edges at any angle:

- Clean capture. The window snapshot runs as a FOREIGN render (an identity render modifier), so hyprglass leaves
  its pane and edge pass out of it (RenderGuards::isForeignRender). They used to be baked in, with the pane
  frosting the snapshot's cleared black: every window came out opaque, and the 3D face guessed transmission from
  luma and fwidth. That key made flat dark areas see-through, so opaque dark apps read as dim mauve glass. It
  forced antialiased glyph fringes opaque with their dark matte (halos round light text). Its 2x2-quad
  derivative turned a rule's sub-texel sampling phase into on/off dashes. And it let a window behind be seen
  almost unfrosted through a front window that was really 85% opaque.
- One glass look. The face now composites the desktop's own stack: the pane (hgMaterial over the 3D backdrop,
  frosted with the preset's blur_sigma, which used to be dead) under the client at its own opacity, then the edge
  pass (hgEdgePass, a port of hyprglass' edge pass) over it. If another plugin still bakes a pane in, the face
  swaps that black-backed pane for the live one.
- Corners. Outside the rounded outline only SOLID decorations stay (Hyprland's reserved extents: border, group
  bar, titlebar). The 2D drop shadow is no longer drawn flat in the window plane: its inner edge followed the
  square client box and left a square wedge past every rounded corner. The outline is antialiased over one screen
  pixel (fwidth of the SDF), instead of a fixed 2-logical-px ramp plus a hard discard.
- Minified text. Snapshot textures get a mip chain once per capture and are sampled with one trilinear +
  anisotropic tap (render.anisotropy, GL_EXT_texture_filter_anisotropic). The 4-tap RGSS stays as the fallback.
- CAS. AMD's limiter min(mn, 2 - mx) is for its doubled soft min/max; this 5-tap form needs 1 - mx. With 2 - mx it
  sharpened at full strength next to white and undershot into dark outlines. The result is also clamped to the
  5-tap neighbourhood: without the clamp, a glyph at the window's opacity (light but not white) still rang into a
  dark ring the flat desktop never shows.
- The glass table gains edge_pass and edge_pass_width. mios-gen projects the whole table from
  [desktop.hyprland.hypr3d.config].glass_preset (the hyprglass preset).
- The status file gains a "texture: mip= aniso= maxAniso=" line.

